      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dunkirk%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s sole remaining glass factory is a highly automated modern facility employing 400 workers.",
